        ("no-buy", "Leave with a record—even if you buy nothing", '''<p>A useful visit can end with no purchase. Record the format options, exact label units, unanswered questions, total cost, seller verification route, and the official source needed next. Do not substitute a random product for one that failed a hard boundary.</p><blockquote>The goal is not to complete a transaction. The goal is to make a decision you can explain tomorrow.</blockquote><p>No seller, product, brand, price, discount, rating, affiliate link, or product image appears here. The repository contains no approved affiliate program or tracking ID, and Big Bud Man did not purchase, use, test, or rank a cannabis product for this guide.</p>'''),
